# drill-opener — talk-track.md present; first message is Template B
NEEDS=talk-track
IFS= read -r -d '' PROMPT <<'PROMPT_EOF' || true
Use the interview-rehearsal skill. Interview prep.
PROMPT_EOF
IFS= read -r -d '' MUST <<'MUST_EOF' || true
Found your talk track for
slots still open\)
\*\*Drill\*\* — I play the interviewer
Drill or rebuild\?
goes to your page under Interview readiness in Confluence
MUST_EOF
IFS= read -r -d '' MUST_NOT <<'MUST_NOT_EOF' || true
Paste whatever you have
Tell me about yourself
[Rr]eading (your|the) talk|[Ff]ound a file|[Ll]et me (read|check|look)
⟨|⟩
MUST_NOT_EOF
